how to play misere unbounded nim game ? 
Misère Nim is exactly like the standard Nim game, except for one critical difference. 
If the size of every pile is 1, then we need to treat it as a special case where we count the number of piles. 
If the count is even, then the first player will win; 
if the count is odd, then the first player will lose.

for even pile case, you just need to copy the other players move; while for odd, empty one pile and again there are even piles